> 2026-08-26: Blocks require human labels; port, connection, and group labels are optional because the core vocabulary does not require them.
> 2026-08-26: Core graphs and layers are not extension-bearing elements; extensions attach only to addressed description, block, port, connection, or group elements.
> 2026-08-26: Generated select definitions use ordinary element productions and the same global address and visibility checks as authored definitions.
> 2026-08-26: Unknown extension parameter spans are opaque serializer exceptions; internal comments and whitespace are retained byte-for-byte while known values are canonicalized.
> 2026-08-26: Projection syntax orders select and invert before decorate and checks; checks name only finalized decoration namespace and parameter values.
