[execution/boundary] Specify static execution boundary (notstarted)
Define the static account for streaming, recurrent, and closed-loop systems without binding projections to runtime. Use the execution schema proposal and case studies to state what is represented, what is an external consumer, and what becomes unresolvable when runtime inputs are absent.
